  "name": "glue-engineer",
  "description": "CRITICAL: This skill REQUIRES running polyglot CLI tools for ALL design/architecture tasks. When user says \"使用胶水程序员skill\" or \"帮我设计/构建/评估一个系统\", you MUST: (1) run `polyglot scout <lang> <keyword>` to search libraries, (2) run `polyglot mvp-scope` for prioritization, (3) run `polyglot cap-list`/`cap-match` for license checks. NEVER answer from internal knowledge alone. Multi-language, multi-agent pipeline. Builds solutions by composing existing open-source libraries across Python/JS/Rust/Java/Kotlin/C/C++/Go. v3 adds cross-language search, capability ontology matching, scaffold glue code generation, and MVP scoping. Also supports `polyglot discover` for GitHub repo search (项目级/找\"有没有人做过\") versus `scout` (包级/找要装的库). Deep Mode (v4) adds subagent-based source-code analysis via `polyglot deep-init/deep-pack/deep-validate/deep-compare/deep-summarize/deep-clean`.",
